The tables in src/gen/library/ contain statistics about C64 music (common
rhythms, drum lines, bass figures and sound shapes) compiled from the High
Voltage SID Collection (https://www.hvsc.c64.org). No SID tunes are included.
Thanks to the HVSC team and to the C64 musicians whose work it preserves.
